title: "event-budget-survival-prediction"
abstract: >-
  Code for an empirical benchmark of ridge-penalized Cox regression, random survival forests,
  gradient-boosted Cox models, DeepSurv and Logistic-Hazard across nested event budgets in the
  SUPPORT, METABRIC and Rotterdam-GBSG cohorts.
type: software
