license: MIT
keywords:
  - survival analysis
  - prediction models
  - machine learning
  - calibration
  - benchmarking
preferred-citation:
  type: article
  title: "When Does Model Complexity Pay Off? An Event-Budget Analysis of Accuracy, Calibration, and Stability in Clinical Survival Prediction"
